### Additional context

I'm not sure where the issue is as yet. I did a little bit of digging and saw that Providers are stripped out of the NgxsModule as part of the `extractImports` when setting up the Wrapper component here: https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/blob/1f62f41d6139972249cb26924a0052ae8aaf9f03/code/frameworks/angular/src/client/angular-beta/StorybookWrapperComponent.ts#L55

This sounds like it would lead to the issue we're seeing. That said, I have verified that the Providers from the module are extracted and included in the Wrapped component here: https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/blob/1f62f41d6139972249cb26924a0052ae8aaf9f03/code/frameworks/angular/src/client/angular-beta/StorybookWrapperComponent.ts#L81

The error occurs when the `NgxsRootModule` is instantiated since it depends on the `StateFactory` in its constructor.

Note this library works just fine in the Angular app itself. I need to do some more tests to see if I can replicate this with a minimal NgModule.
